  "plain": "Wreckage said to come from the 1947 crash near Roswell, New Mexico, where many believe an alien craft came down, was kept in a hangar, with a bathroom on the other side. A man named Charles Hall, who says he spent three years among tall white aliens at Area 51, a secret US Air Force site in Nevada, tells it as something he saw. Asked what it was like, he said only that \"that wreckage had the bathroom on the other side\", suggesting he was close to it."
